A) Settlement Command - Queue - single consumer Ledger
B) Payment received broadcast - Event Bus - multiple independent consumer
C) SMS/Push Notification - Queue - each has unique message by each worker
D) Fraud Score Req - Queue - each user has separate Req
E) Acc state change events - Event Bus - multiple microservice should react
F) End-of day reconciliation - Queue - worker will process each file one by one.

Architecture:

merchant api -> load balancer -> payment core
                                    ↓
                                    Ledger Service -> Ledger DB
                                    ↓
                                    Fraud Engine -> Fraud DB
                                    ↓
                                    Notification Hub
                                    ↓
                                    Analytics Pipeline
                                    ↓
                                    Reconcillation worker -> Reconcillation DB
                                    ↓
                                    Compilance service
                                    ↓
                                    Merchant Portal
                                    